---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { CATEGORIES } from '../data/categories';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | Micro Signal Cosmos"
  description="Learn about Micro Signal Cosmos, our editorial mission, vision, and the team exploring the universe of technology, science, and artificial intelligence."
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="bg-[#0B1020] py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="container-main">

      <!-- Hero Section -->
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-sky-400/20 bg-sky-400/5 px-4 py-2">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-sky-400"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-sky-300 uppercase">
            About the Publication
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          Discover More.
          <span class="mt-2 block bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-400 via-blue-400 to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
            Understand Better.
          </span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-7 text-base leading-8 text-slate-400 sm:text-lg">
          Micro Signal Cosmos is a modern digital technology and science publication dedicated to translating complex discoveries, artificial intelligence advancements, and technological shifts into clear, engaging, and accessible knowledge.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Mission Card -->
      <div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-4xl rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#141C2E] p-8 sm:p-12">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-sky-400 uppercase">
          Our Editorial Mission
        </span>

        <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl">
          Finding the Signal in a Universe of Noise
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 text-sm leading-8 text-slate-400 sm:text-base">
          <p>
            In today's fast-moving digital world, information is everywhere, but genuine understanding is rare. Daily feeds are flooded with sensational headlines, jargon-heavy research papers, and surface-level summaries that leave readers more confused than informed.
          </p>

          <p>
            The name <strong class="text-white font-semibold">Micro Signal Cosmos</strong> reflects our core philosophy: just as astronomers detect faint micro-signals from distant galaxies to unlock the mysteries of the universe, we filter through the noise to identify the crucial, foundational breakthroughs in science, artificial intelligence, and computing that truly matter.
          </p>

          <p>
            Whether explaining how large language models identify linguistic patterns, investigating new scientific instruments probing space, or providing step-by-step practical guides, our mission is simple: to help curious minds explore without intimidation and understand with confidence.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Pillars Grid -->
      <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-4xl">
        <div class="text-center">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-sky-400 uppercase">
            What We Explore
          </p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
            Our Core Pillars
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400">
            Carefully curated areas of knowledge designed for lifelong learners and digital explorers.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          {CATEGORIES.slice(0, 6).map((cat) => (
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#141C2E] p-6 transition-all hover:border-sky-400/30">
              <span class:list={[
                'flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border text-xs font-bold mb-5',
                cat.accent === 'sky' ? 'border-sky-400/20 bg-sky-400/10 text-sky-400' : 'border-purple-400/20 bg-purple-400/10 text-purple-400'
              ]}>
                {cat.icon}
              </span>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">{cat.name}</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">{cat.description}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Editorial Values -->
      <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-4xl border-t border-white/10 pt-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl text-center">
          Our Editorial Standards
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0E1628] p-6">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-sky-400">01</span>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-white">Accuracy First</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
              We fact-check our concepts, cite primary scientific sources, and verify technical explanations before publishing.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0E1628] p-6">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-400">02</span>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-white">Clarity Without Hype</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
              We avoid sensationalism and clickbait. We explain what technologies actually do, what their limitations are, and why they matter.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0E1628] p-6">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-sky-400">03</span>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-bold text-white">Respect for the Reader</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
              Your attention is valuable. We write concise, structured, and visually engaging editorial pieces that respect your time.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Connect Banner -->
        <div class="mt-16 text-center">
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
            Have thoughts, story suggestions, or questions?
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
            <a
              href="/contact/"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-sky-400 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-950 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-sky-300 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-sky-400"
            >
              Get in Touch
            </a>
            <a
              href="/"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/15 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-all hover:bg-white/5 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-sky-400"
            >
              Explore Homepage
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

